0 19 504 [
[(The [declare] object adds one or more directories as a search path and/or)]
[(pre-loads one or more libraries in preparation for loading a patch from a)]
[(file. The usage is "declare [-flag value] [-flag value] ..." where the flag)]
[(can be:)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 212 190 [
[(no error is given if the paths don't exist)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 22 158 [
[(The "-path" and "-lib" flags will fall back to the other search paths if the)]
[(relative path to the patch does not exist. To avoid checking further, use an)]
[(explicit relative path by prepending "./" or "../" to the path or lib name.)]
[(If you don't do it, the other search paths will be \050in order of priority\051:)]
[(the user added search paths \050set in "Preferences => Path"\051 and, lastly, the)]
[(standard path \050a.k.a the 'extra' folder\051, which is also searched with)]
[('-stdpath'/'-stdlib' \050but only this folder is searched in this case\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 595 606 [
[(Paths declared with '-path' will have top search priority when loading the)]
[(patch. Next priority is the relative path, then user added search paths)]
[(and finally the standard path \050a.k.a the 'extra' folder\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 596 547 [
[(Since the 'extra' folder is part of the search path but last in priority,)]
[(you can use [declare -stdpath ./] to ensure it has search priority. Note)]
[(that the order you specify '-path' flags also specify the search priority.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
