0 596 393 [
[(Note however that while [declare] only adds search paths for the owning)]
[(patch, when you load a library \050via startup or [declare]\051 all externals)]
[(get preloaded and prevail even in other patches with priority. This may)]
[(cause some issues and you may need to adopt slash declarations to find an)]
[(external with the same name in a given path \050as in [library/objectname].\051)]
[(These are edge cases anyway and for more details on how external loading)]
[(works in Pd, please refer to the chapter 4 of Pd's manual.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
